sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    U->>+A: Create order
    Note over A,D: Transaction boundary
    alt Stock available
        A->>+D: Reserve stock
        D-->>-A: Reserved
        A-->>U: Confirmed
    else Sold out
        A-->>U: Rejected
    end
    loop Retry delivery
        A->>A: Schedule notification
        A->>U: Order update
    end
    deactivate A
    Note right of D: Durable records
